St","Sun-Thu 11AM-10PM, Fri Sat 11AM-11PM","","","","r","Inside the Tai Nam Market Center, this is a Thai bakery with a nice sit-down area to relax over coffee, although they do have a full lunch and dinner menu."],["Vinh Phat BBQ","restaurant",41.97315,-87.65835,"1113 W Argyle St","9AM-7PM daily","","","","r","There are two sides to this Vietnamese BBQ: birds and bread. The baguettes are priced at a very Vietnam-like three-for-1, while the BBQ'd birds get chopped up into bánh mì sandwiches."],["Gigio's","restaurant",41.96661,-87.65799,"4643 N Broadway St","Sun-Thu 9AM-midnight, Fri Sat 9AM-2AM","","","","r","Really good greasy thin-crust pizza by the slice — never mind the way the place looks. It's open late in case you're hungry after a show at the Green Mill, the Aragon or the Riviera on the other side of the tracks."],["Fat Cat Bar & Grill","bar",41.97009,-87.65993,"4840 N Broadway St","Mon-Fri 4PM-2AM, Sat 11AM-3AM, Sun 11AM-2AM","","","","r","Brand new and very popular, with decor and cocktails that attempt to evoke the Art Deco class of the original Uptown."]]}